    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "SYSTEM TIMETABLE\nEffective May 1 through May 31, 1999\nNew Destination-\nPhilly.\nOnATA lou're On Yagatier",
      "NONSTOP SCHEDULED SERVICE ROUTES\n25 years of great destinations,\nlow fares \u0026 priceless memories.\nMILWAUKEE\nMADISON •\nDES MOINES •\nGRAND\nRAPIDS\nLANSING\nCHICAGO • DAYTON\nINDIANAPOLIS\nPHILADELPHIA\nSAANCISCO\nLAS VEGAS\nLOS ANGELES\nPHOENIX\nDENVER\n(JFK 6/99)\nDALLAS\nORLANDO\n•FI: LAUDERDALE\nHONOLULU MAUI\nCALL YOUR TRAVEL AGENT,\nBOOK ONLINE AT ATA.COM\nOR CALL ATA AT\n1-800-I-FLY-ATA\nST. PETE\nSARASOTA\nFT. MYERS\n(6/99)\nCONNECTION\n•PoPoD• Operated by Chicago Express\nCANCUN •\n6/99)\nDUBLIN\nSHANNON C\n(6/99)\nSAN JUAN"
